Show server-sampled Xray traffic and observations

Usage: xrm stats [OPTIONS]

OPTIONS:
  -h,   --help            Show this help message 
        --watch           Refresh the shared server sample every two seconds 

GLOBAL OPTIONS (before the command):
        --socket PATH     xrmd Unix domain socket 
        --json            Write machine readable output 
        --verbose         Include original diagnostics in human errors 

Examples:
  xrm stats
  xrm --json stats --watch
